    "Buy when the MACD line (12, 26) crosses above its 9-period signal line while the Parabolic SAR (0.02, 0.02, 0.2) is below the price.",
    "Put the stop at the Parabolic SAR and the target at 1 times the risk.",
    "Risking the same 20 USDT per trade: a stop closer than 1% is widened to 1% and one wider than 15% is cut to 15%, so a position never passes 2,000 USDT.",
    "Hold one position per coin at a time."
  ],
  "notExpressed": [
    "Entering later when the SAR flips below the price while the MACD is still crossed up: the test buys only on the MACD cross itself",
    "Capping the stop at \"0.7\" when the SAR is far away (the video leaves the unit unsaid); the test's cap is 15%",
    "Data Trader trades EUR/USD on 30-minute candles; the test runs on hourly crypto candles",
